  "physicalDescription": "Brush pot of porcelain, square, painted in the colours of the famille verte and gilt. Sqaure ground-plan with four scrolled feeet at the corners. Each side has a rectanglar panel surrounded by a border of flowers and leaves on a black dotted ground or a ground of black roe diaper. Two of the four panels contain lake-scenes with figures. The other two contain a bird on a branch. Round the top, a border of key-pattern in black and green. ",
